The agreement specifies that plots are allocated according to a defined rule. Each plot is exactly one acre in size. [[cite:obs-62ad415058090c9d71af70dc2d06c05d2ddcfbff "The agreement states that each plot is one acre in size."]]

The allocation rule for plots is that they are distributed based on a lottery system among eligible applicants. [[cite:obs-2f05cf76ed4942c136e57c04c58d41c79963eea9 "The agreement states that plots are allocated by lottery among eligible applicants."]]